{# Apps page intro: independent apps in any framework, each in a sandboxed iframe, plugged into one Shellui shell with one look. Scoped under .mi, uses --color-primary, --color-primary-ink, --color-primary-foreground, --font-sans and .dark. Framework logos: simple-icons (CC0). #}
<div class="overflow-hidden{% if mfeBare %} h-full{% else %} rounded-xl border border-border{% endif %}">
